    "_postman_id": "c3d4e5f6-a7b8-9012-cdef-123456789012",
    "name": "Data Consents CRUD",
    "description": "# Data Consents API\n\nFull CRUD for the `data_consent` table with multipart **signature** file upload on create/update.\n\n## Auth\n- Header: `API-KEY` (required)\n- Body/query: `token`, `requester` (required on all endpoints)\n\n## Signature file (VM4)\n- Field name: `signature`\n- Type: file (form-data)\n- Allowed: PNG, JPEG, JPG, PDF\n- Max size: 5 MB\n- Uploaded via `upload_to_vm4()` to path `assets/data_consents/{id}/`\n- DB `signature` column stores the **full VM4 URL** (e.g. `https://file.myt-emr.com/assets/data_consents/1/....png`)\n- GET returns the same value as both `signature` and `signature_url`\n\n## Multi-branch sync\nCreate, update, and delete propagate to all branch databases:\n- `master` (0), `mobile` (1), `oakridge` (2), `mactan` (3), `consolacion` (4), `mantlewood` (7)\n\n- Returned `data_consent_id` is the **master** insert ID\n- Signature VM4 URL is synced to all branch DB rows with that ID\n- **GET** reads from **master only**\n- Create/update run a consistency check; mismatch returns `400`:\n  `\"Data inconsistency detected between master and {branch}.\"`\n",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
