        "description": "## GET `/data_consents/get`\n\nReturns data consent records with optional filters.\n\n### Query params\n| Param | Required | Notes |\n|-------|----------|-------|\n| `token` | yes | Auth token |\n| `requester` | yes | User id |\n| `data_consent_id` | no | Filter by id |\n| `first_name` / `last_name` / `middle_name` / `date_of_birth` | no | Exact match filters |\n| `term` | no | Search first/middle/last name |\n| `page` | no | 1-based page |\n| `data_size` | no | Page size |\n\n### Multi-branch\nReads from **master database only**.\n\n### Signature URL\n`signature` and `signature_url` are the full VM4 URL."
      },
