        "description": "## POST `/data_consents/create`\n\nCreates a data consent record. Use **form-data** so the signature can be sent as a file.\n\n### Required form fields\n| Field | Type |\n|-------|------|\n| `token` | text |\n| `requester` | text |\n| `first_name` | text |\n| `last_name` | text |\n\n### Optional form fields\n| Field | Type | Notes |\n|-------|------|-------|\n| `middle_name` | text | |\n| `date_of_birth` | text | YYYY-MM-DD |\n| `is_data_privay_consent` | text | 0 or 1 |\n| `is_email_consent` | text | 0 or 1 |\n| `signature` | **file** | PNG/JPEG/JPG/PDF, max 5 MB \u2014 uploaded to VM4 |\n\n### Multi-branch\nInserts into master plus mobile, oakridge, mactan, consolacion, and mantlewood. Signature VM4 URL synced to all branch DBs."
      },
