        "description": "## POST `/data_consents/update`\n\nUpdates a data consent record. Use **form-data** when uploading a new signature file.\n\n### Required\n- `token`, `requester`, `data_consent_id`\n\n### Multi-branch\nUpdates the same `data_consent_id` on all branch databases. Optional new signature file is uploaded to VM4; the new full URL replaces `signature` on all branches."
